### 결제 요청 (Phase 2: PENDING 저장 후 PG 호출)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: your-login-id

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9814-1451"
}

### Expected: 200 OK, paymentId/orderId/status(PENDING)
### PG-Simulator 미기동 시: Connection refused 등 Feign 예외

### 결제 콜백 (PG-Simulator가 호출, Phase 3)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "pg-tx-001",
  "orderId": 1,
  "success": true,
  "failureReason": null
}

### 실패 콜백 예시
# POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments/callback
# {"paymentId": "pg-tx-002", "orderId": 1, "success": false, "failureReason": "LIMIT_EXCEEDED"}
